        "The shared analysis_options.yaml that every other sample in the repo "
        + "includes, so lint rules are set once for the whole repository.",
        [
            "It is repository infrastructure, not an app — there is nothing to render.",
            "The Rust equivalent already exists here and is not a screen: the workspace lints, rustfmt.toml and clippy in CI.",
        ],
